<span style="color: red">05.29.2002</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Ben</span><br /><br />Test test... testing 1,2,3... this thing on? sup bill, congrats on getting things working. Maybe we have to work on my server next . =OP<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">05.28.2002</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Bill</span><br /><br />This is a test of the newly remodeled guestbook.. I need to inspire some more signing, and hopefully increase my traffic to here.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">05.30.2001</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Jen</span><br /><br />Nice, Bill... Bet you wonder how I found this, huh? I like what Deb wrote. She knows you well. :) Long time, no see. Talk to you later.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">04.13.2001</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Ulyssa</span><br /><br />I was told about your page from Mike and Nate and thought I would drop a line to say hello. You're page looks great. Have a great day.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">12.13.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Missy Moo</span><br /><br />ha, i've escaped your email subject field... Muss ich etwas auf Deutsch sagen, oder nicht? well anyway great site... later <br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.17.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Nate</span><br /><br />your page looks pretty nice man. Just thought i would come on here and drop you a line and such. I see that missy signed before me. That's cool. Remember when you buy stock in Capsule Corp. you buy something you can trust! lol later man<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.19.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Missy Moo</span><br /><br />Page is lookin nice Little Billy.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.8.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Josh Shepler</span><br /><br />Das ist Zer Gute!!!! Nice page Bro!<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.6.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Dave Packard</span><br /><br />Let me just restate my opinion. Bill is king of everything internet. Brilliant stuff my friend. very nice design.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.5.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Tamisha</span><br /><br />Hey just read your poems, pretty cool. Hope your doing okay away from us here and we miss you! Deb says she's still corupting youth. P.S. What's a good movie you've seen lately?<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">10.5.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Deb Burns</span><br /><br />Bill, just accessed this sight. Liked some, others will have to read again. Some sounded like you, and others made me wonder who held you hostage.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.25.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Brad</span><br /><br />Anyone who is capable of getting themselves made president should on no account be allowed to do the job.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.24.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Doug</span><br /><br />Das ist sehr gut!<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.22.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Annie</span><br /><br />I just thought I would sign it too!<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">chelle</span><br /><br />Hey there Fred!!! I feel so special signin your book. Course, I guess I'm not the only special one!! lol <br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Konrad</span><br /><br />neeto!<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Torvik</span><br /><br />dude? um... hi! I think. So, this is what those guestbook things is like, very cool. I'll have to yoink one of these sometime.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Josh</span><br /><br />stuff...<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Dan</span><br /><br />Guestbooken signen und german typin und nothin sayin und laterin seein.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Mike</span><br /><br />Hey there Bill, pretty cool, I guess I am third to sign your book. Later!!!!!!!!<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.20.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Adam</span><br /><br />I'm the first second person to sign his guest book.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><span style="color: red">08.19.2000</span><br />By: <span style="color: yellow ">Bill</span><br /><br />I'll be the first to sign, I hope everyone will stop in from time to time and spout something good. Talk to you all later.<br /><br /><hr class=redstar><br /><a href="gbsign.htm">Leave your mark</a></BODY></html>